## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, React and TypeScript engineer, backend developer, database architect, AI engineer, product designer, and application security specialist.

Build a professional, responsive, functional web application named Recyvora.

Recyvora is an integrated recycling, scrap collection, e-waste management, and reusable-products marketplace platform.

The application must support household customers, business customers, scrap collectors, recycling partners, and administrators.

The goal is to transform the product specification into a working application suitable for:

* Product demonstrations.
* Business presentations.
* Startup validation.
* Realistic user testing.
* Future production deployment.

Do not create only a landing page.

Do not deliver only a frontend mockup.

Implement the application architecture, pages, workflows, data models, API integration, validation, authentication, and AI features appropriate to the supported development environment.

If a feature requires external credentials, implement the integration safely and document the required configuration.

Never claim that an unimplemented feature is working.

